{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-on-business","title":"对商业界的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-in-japan","title":"对日本商业界的影响","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business/influence-in-japan","wordCount":1955,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-management-influence","title":"全球性的经营影响","url":"/c/people/kazuo-inamori/influence-and-legacy/influence-on-business/global-management-influence","wordCount":1707,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 对商业界的影响\n\n本章呈现稻盛和夫对商业界的影响。在日本，稻盛和夫被尊为\"经营之圣\"，深刻地影响了日本企业的经营理念；在全球，他的经营哲学远播海外，尤其在中国赢得了广泛的赞誉。两篇文档，分别呈现他对日本商业界的影响，以及全球性的经营影响。\n"}